The single biggest docs gap: two agents on different hosts talking is undocumented, and the local-vs-relay inbox distinction is invisible. Ship a cross-machine quickstart (install, local prove, relay setup/register, discover peers, relay dm send, receive via monitor/poll, verify) with real expected output and an inline symptom/cause/fix table. One end-to-end worked example would have saved the dogfood session the most time. Lead with honest alpha status. Source: friction-points-cn.md.